# Model card for rdh (medium)

* Language: nl_BE (Dutch, Belgium)
* Speakers: 1
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://github.com/r-dh/dutch-vl-tts
* License:  CC0 1.0 Universal

## Training

Trained from scratch, with MRD and SDP. The audio was filtered first with a 70 Hz high-pass and a 50 Hz notch to remove rumble and mains hum.

Default inference settings are noise_scale 0.5 and noise_w 0.333.

Requires Piper 1.5 or higher.
